==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*werh₁-}}
From {{der|en|fro|verbal}}, from {{der|en|LL.|verbālis|t=belonging to a [[word]]}}. Equivalent to {{suffix|en|verb|al}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈvɜː.bəl/|[ˈvɜː.bɫ̩]|a=RP}}, {{enPR|vûrʹ-bəl}}
* {{IPA|en|/ˈvɝ.bəl/|[ˈvɜ˞.bɫ̩]|a=US}}, {{enPR|vûrʹ-bəl}}
** {{audio|en|en-us-verbal.ogg|a=US}}
* {{audio|en|en-au-verbal.ogg|a=AU}}
